/**
 * What a clip reports (PRP-062): how far its child sticks out. Plain data,
 * in its own module so `views` can name it without an import cycle.
 *
 * Used by: views, mapping, diff, build, lib
 */

/**
 * How far a clip's child sticks out, in pixels: `across` at the end side (the
 * right, or the left in right-to-left text) and `down` at the bottom; 0 when
 * it fits. The child sits at the top start, so it never sticks out at the
 * top or the start.
 */
public struct Overflowing {
    public across: i64,
    public down: i64,
}
